  "notes": "Fifteen armour pieces, three tiers across five slots, plus the two lights. A full tier-1 set is 0.23 DR, a full tier-3 set 0.70, against a hard cap of 0.72: scavenging can make you tough, never immune.\n\n`light` is what Phase 4's renderer punches out of the darkness and `burn` is how many seconds of being lit the thing holds. The torch is the first night's answer — sticks and fiber — and burns itself away. The flashlight is brighter and reaches much further because it is a cone rather than a puddle, and it eats batteries, which you find before you can make them.",
